{
 "title": "POV: You Earn $4,000 a Month and Still Save $800 \u2014 Your Coworkers Can't Figure Out How",
 "duration": 238.032,
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 6.857,
   "line_starts": [
    0.3,
    5.164
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 0.3,
     "end": 2.849,
     "text": "It's Friday. Payday. You and your coworkers"
    },
    {
     "start": 2.849,
     "end": 4.864,
     "text": "all just got paid the same amount."
    },
    {
     "start": 5.164,
     "end": 6.407,
     "text": "Four thousand dollars."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 6.857,
   "end": 13.579,
   "line_starts": [
    6.857,
    10.13
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 6.857,
     "end": 8.69,
     "text": "Jake is already talking about the new"
    },
    {
     "start": 8.69,
     "end": 9.83,
     "text": "truck he just financed."
    },
    {
     "start": 10.13,
     "end": 12.043,
     "text": "Mia is planning a weekend trip she'll"
    },
    {
     "start": 12.043,
     "end": 13.129,
     "text": "put on a credit card."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 13.579,
   "end": 19.836,
   "line_starts": [
    13.579,
    17.035
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 13.579,
     "end": 15.597,
     "text": "And you? You already know exactly where"
    },
    {
     "start": 15.597,
     "end": 16.735,
     "text": "every dollar is going."
    },
    {
     "start": 17.035,
     "end": 19.386,
     "text": "Because you made that decision once, months ago."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 19.836,
   "end": 25.898,
   "line_starts": [
    19.836,
    24.816
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 19.836,
     "end": 20.813,
     "text": "Two weeks from now,"
    },
    {
     "start": 20.813,
     "end": 22.613,
     "text": "Jake and Mia will be checking their"
    },
    {
     "start": 22.613,
     "end": 24.516,
     "text": "balance, wondering where it all went."
    },
    {
     "start": 24.816,
     "end": 25.448,
     "text": "You won't."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 25.898,
   "end": 32.042,
   "line_starts": [
    25.898,
    29.212
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 25.898,
     "end": 27.484,
     "text": "This isn't about earning more."
    },
    {
     "start": 27.484,
     "end": 28.912,
     "text": "It's about one simple rule."
    },
    {
     "start": 29.212,
     "end": 30.164,
     "text": "Here's how it works,"
    },
    {
     "start": 30.164,
     "end": 31.592,
     "text": "and how you can start tonight."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 32.042,
   "end": 37.669,
   "line_starts": [
    32.042,
    34.628
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 32.042,
     "end": 34.328,
     "text": "The rule is called fifty, thirty, twenty."
    },
    {
     "start": 34.628,
     "end": 36.479,
     "text": "Fifty percent of your take home pay"
    },
    {
     "start": 36.479,
     "end": 37.219,
     "text": "goes to needs."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 37.669,
   "end": 43.698,
   "line_starts": [
    37.669,
    39.414
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 37.669,
     "end": 39.114,
     "text": "Thirty percent goes to wants."
    },
    {
     "start": 39.414,
     "end": 41.613,
     "text": "And twenty percent goes to your future."
    },
    {
     "start": 41.613,
     "end": 43.248,
     "text": "Savings, and paying off debt."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 43.698,
   "end": 50.429,
   "line_starts": [
    43.698
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 43.698,
     "end": 45.397,
     "text": "On four thousand dollars a month,"
    },
    {
     "start": 45.397,
     "end": 46.941,
     "text": "that's two thousand for needs,"
    },
    {
     "start": 46.941,
     "end": 48.228,
     "text": "twelve hundred for wants,"
    },
    {
     "start": 48.228,
     "end": 49.979,
     "text": "and eight hundred for your future."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 50.429,
   "end": 56.562,
   "line_starts": [
    50.429,
    53.11
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 50.429,
     "end": 52.81,
     "text": "Simple, right? But the magic isn't the math."
    },
    {
     "start": 53.11,
     "end": 55.056,
     "text": "The magic is that you decide before"
    },
    {
     "start": 55.056,
     "end": 56.112,
     "text": "the money shows up."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 56.562,
   "end": 64.432,
   "line_starts": [
    56.562,
    61.818
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 56.562,
     "end": 58.043,
     "text": "Let's start with needs."
    },
    {
     "start": 58.043,
     "end": 60.489,
     "text": "Rent. Groceries. Utilities. Insurance."
    },
    {
     "start": 60.489,
     "end": 61.518,
     "text": "Getting to work."
    },
    {
     "start": 61.818,
     "end": 63.338,
     "text": "The things you'd still pay for if"
    },
    {
     "start": 63.338,
     "end": 63.982,
     "text": "life got hard."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 64.432,
   "end": 70.061,
   "line_starts": [
    64.432,
    66.375
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 64.432,
     "end": 66.075,
     "text": "Here's where most people get stuck."
    },
    {
     "start": 66.375,
     "end": 68.448,
     "text": "Jake's truck payment is eight hundred and"
    },
    {
     "start": 68.448,
     "end": 69.611,
     "text": "ninety dollars a month."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 70.061,
   "end": 78.909,
   "line_starts": [
    70.061,
    75.384
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 70.061,
     "end": 71.551,
     "text": "Add his rent and insurance,"
    },
    {
     "start": 71.551,
     "end": 73.759,
     "text": "and his needs are already eating seventy"
    },
    {
     "start": 73.759,
     "end": 75.084,
     "text": "percent of his paycheck."
    },
    {
     "start": 75.384,
     "end": 76.922,
     "text": "There's nothing left to save,"
    },
    {
     "start": 76.922,
     "end": 78.459,
     "text": "before the month even starts."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 78.909,
   "end": 85.134,
   "line_starts": [
    78.909,
    81.382
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 78.909,
     "end": 80.292,
     "text": "You drive a ten year old car"
    },
    {
     "start": 80.292,
     "end": 81.082,
     "text": "that's paid off."
    },
    {
     "start": 81.382,
     "end": 83.246,
     "text": "It's not exciting. But it costs you"
    },
    {
     "start": 83.246,
     "end": 84.684,
     "text": "almost nothing every month."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 85.134,
   "end": 93.305,
   "line_starts": [
    85.134,
    88.079
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 85.134,
     "end": 87.779,
     "text": "If your needs are over fifty percent, don't panic."
    },
    {
     "start": 88.079,
     "end": 89.71,
     "text": "Look at the big three first."
    },
    {
     "start": 89.71,
     "end": 91.049,
     "text": "Housing, car, and food."
    },
    {
     "start": 91.049,
     "end": 92.855,
     "text": "That's where the real money is."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s14",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 93.305,
   "end": 100.412,
   "line_starts": [
    93.305,
    95.203
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 93.305,
     "end": 94.903,
     "text": "Now the fun part. Wants."
    },
    {
     "start": 95.203,
     "end": 96.939,
     "text": "Eating out. Streaming. Hobbies."
    },
    {
     "start": 96.939,
     "end": 99.962,
     "text": "That concert. Yes, you're allowed to enjoy your money."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s15",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 100.412,
   "end": 106.495,
   "line_starts": [
    100.412,
    104.156
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 100.412,
     "end": 102.349,
     "text": "This is what most budgets get wrong."
    },
    {
     "start": 102.349,
     "end": 103.856,
     "text": "They try to cut all the fun."
    },
    {
     "start": 104.156,
     "end": 106.045,
     "text": "And then people quit after two weeks."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s16",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 106.495,
   "end": 112.312,
   "line_starts": [
    106.495,
    109.277
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 106.495,
     "end": 107.952,
     "text": "With fifty, thirty, twenty,"
    },
    {
     "start": 107.952,
     "end": 108.977,
     "text": "the fun is planned."
    },
    {
     "start": 109.277,
     "end": 110.363,
     "text": "So when you spend it,"
    },
    {
     "start": 110.363,
     "end": 111.862,
     "text": "you spend it with zero guilt."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s17",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 112.312,
   "end": 118.388,
   "line_starts": [
    112.312,
    115.573
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 112.312,
     "end": 114.067,
     "text": "Mia doesn't have a wants budget."
    },
    {
     "start": 114.067,
     "end": 115.273,
     "text": "She has a credit card."
    },
    {
     "start": 115.573,
     "end": 117.938,
     "text": "And it charges her over twenty percent interest."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s18",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 118.388,
   "end": 123.614,
   "line_starts": [
    118.388
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 118.388,
     "end": 120.179,
     "text": "That weekend trip will cost her a"
    },
    {
     "start": 120.179,
     "end": 121.536,
     "text": "lot more than she thinks,"
    },
    {
     "start": 121.536,
     "end": 123.164,
     "text": "if it takes months to pay off."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s19",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 123.614,
   "end": 130.237,
   "line_starts": [
    123.614,
    127.692
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 123.614,
     "end": 125.423,
     "text": "And now the part that changes your"
    },
    {
     "start": 125.423,
     "end": 127.392,
     "text": "life. Twenty percent for your future."
    },
    {
     "start": 127.692,
     "end": 129.787,
     "text": "For you, that's eight hundred dollars a month."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s20",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 130.237,
   "end": 135.785,
   "line_starts": [
    130.237,
    133.379
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 130.237,
     "end": 132.019,
     "text": "The trick? It leaves your account the"
    },
    {
     "start": 132.019,
     "end": 133.078,
     "text": "same day you get paid."
    },
    {
     "start": 133.379,
     "end": 135.335,
     "text": "Automatically. You never even see it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s21",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 135.785,
   "end": 141.697,
   "line_starts": [
    135.785
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 135.785,
     "end": 137.957,
     "text": "First, you build an emergency fund."
    },
    {
     "start": 137.957,
     "end": 139.509,
     "text": "A few months of expenses,"
    },
    {
     "start": 139.509,
     "end": 141.247,
     "text": "sitting there, just in case."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s22",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 141.697,
   "end": 147.645,
   "line_starts": [
    141.697,
    144.446
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 141.697,
     "end": 143.51,
     "text": "Then, if you have high interest debt,"
    },
    {
     "start": 143.51,
     "end": 144.147,
     "text": "you crush it."
    },
    {
     "start": 144.446,
     "end": 146.508,
     "text": "And after that, you start investing for"
    },
    {
     "start": 146.508,
     "end": 147.195,
     "text": "the long run."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s23",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 147.645,
   "end": 152.182,
   "line_starts": [
    147.645,
    149.238
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 147.645,
     "end": 148.938,
     "text": "Fast forward one year."
    },
    {
     "start": 149.238,
     "end": 150.514,
     "text": "The office is buzzing."
    },
    {
     "start": 150.514,
     "end": 151.732,
     "text": "Rumors about layoffs."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s24",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 152.182,
   "end": 157.922,
   "line_starts": [
    152.182,
    156.044
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 152.182,
     "end": 154.233,
     "text": "Jake can't sleep. One missed paycheck,"
    },
    {
     "start": 154.233,
     "end": 155.744,
     "text": "and the truck is in trouble."
    },
    {
     "start": 156.044,
     "end": 157.472,
     "text": "Mia's card is maxed out."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s25",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 157.922,
   "end": 164.001,
   "line_starts": [
    157.922,
    160.699
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 157.922,
     "end": 160.399,
     "text": "You? You have almost ten thousand dollars saved."
    },
    {
     "start": 160.699,
     "end": 162.195,
     "text": "You're not happy about the news."
    },
    {
     "start": 162.195,
     "end": 163.551,
     "text": "But you're not scared either."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s26",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 164.001,
   "end": 168.499,
   "line_starts": [
    164.001,
    166.452
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 164.001,
     "end": 166.152,
     "text": "That's what money really buys. Not stuff."
    },
    {
     "start": 166.452,
     "end": 168.049,
     "text": "Options. And peace of mind."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s27",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 168.499,
   "end": 177.97,
   "line_starts": [
    168.499,
    170.283
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 168.499,
     "end": 169.983,
     "text": "Now jump five years ahead."
    },
    {
     "start": 170.283,
     "end": 172.106,
     "text": "If that eight hundred a month was"
    },
    {
     "start": 172.106,
     "end": 174.316,
     "text": "invested and grew around seven percent a"
    },
    {
     "start": 174.316,
     "end": 176.249,
     "text": "year, it could be worth about fifty"
    },
    {
     "start": 176.249,
     "end": 177.52,
     "text": "seven thousand dollars."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s28",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 177.97,
   "end": 183.784,
   "line_starts": [
    177.97,
    181.012
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 177.97,
     "end": 179.284,
     "text": "Markets go up and down,"
    },
    {
     "start": 179.284,
     "end": 180.712,
     "text": "so nothing is guaranteed."
    },
    {
     "start": 181.012,
     "end": 183.334,
     "text": "But time and consistency are on your side."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s29",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 183.784,
   "end": 188.948,
   "line_starts": [
    183.784,
    185.824
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 183.784,
     "end": 185.524,
     "text": "Jake is on his second truck loan."
    },
    {
     "start": 185.824,
     "end": 188.498,
     "text": "Mia is still paying for trips she barely remembers."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s30",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 188.948,
   "end": 194.06,
   "line_starts": [
    188.948,
    192.038
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 188.948,
     "end": 190.243,
     "text": "And here's the crazy part."
    },
    {
     "start": 190.243,
     "end": 191.738,
     "text": "You all earned the same money."
    },
    {
     "start": 192.038,
     "end": 193.61,
     "text": "The only difference was a plan."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s31",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 194.06,
   "end": 200.982,
   "line_starts": [
    194.06
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 194.06,
     "end": 195.195,
     "text": "So how do you start?"
    },
    {
     "start": 195.195,
     "end": 197.523,
     "text": "Tonight, take your monthly take home pay."
    },
    {
     "start": 197.523,
     "end": 200.532,
     "text": "Not your salary. What actually lands in your account."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s32",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 200.982,
   "end": 206.055,
   "line_starts": [
    200.982,
    204.29
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 200.982,
     "end": 202.457,
     "text": "Multiply it by point five,"
    },
    {
     "start": 202.457,
     "end": 203.99,
     "text": "point three, and point two."
    },
    {
     "start": 204.29,
     "end": 205.605,
     "text": "Those are your three numbers."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s33",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
